  "details": "Button shadow looks wrong. It looks like total random shadow or like the button would fly away. But when i hover any button i expect to virtually slightly touch it. that means shadows should get slightly smaller and less smooth while hovering a button. UI and UX should indicate that i can press that button instead of pulling it out. No other Button has this shadow. or zooming icons that are immersion breaking and breaking. As a user i expect text to be written/graved on a button. Icon zooming is also breaking padding pattern when menu is in compact mode",
